% Sequences of foreign words get no internal linguistic structure; they are
% represented by a 'fw_seq' relation combining the parts.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_ForeignExpressions/):
%   h0:fw_seq[ARG1 i1, ARG2 i2]
%   h0:[ARG0 i1]
%   h0:[ARG0 i2]

pattern { F [pred="fw_seq"] }
